{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"w":0.061601638793945312,"x":0.09445585339563517,"c":1,"y":0.04941860467883108,"h":0.014593194719612734,"t":"Test 4"},{"y":0.097345132486204689,"t":"Questions 14-17","x":0.094455851374523433,"w":0.17864476521809897,"h":0.014573471947053829,"c":1},{"h":0.017542189764062299,"w":0.43326487223307292,"c":1,"x":0.092402471377328418,"t":"Reading Passage 2 has six paragraphs, A-F.","y":0.12936046513819421},{"w":0.49707361857096355,"y":0.15985308290083577,"x":0.092341833434229748,"h":0.018582424512655016,"c":1,"t":"Which paragraph contains the following information?"},{"y":0.1917404130157363,"c":1,"x":0.094455846726911361,"t":"Write the correct letter, A-F, in boxes 14-17 on your answer sheet.","w":0.63244354248046875,"h":0.017699115044247704},{"x":0.09240248050188711,"w":0.83572891235351554,"t":"14 reference to the rapidly increasing need for one raw material in the transport industry","y":0.21504424805371924,"h":0.01751389123697189,"c":1},{"t":"15 a rough estimate of the area of the Earth covered by the oceans","x":0.092402471728339514,"y":0.2398230091213851,"w":0.64476384480794269,"h":0.01599094424627534,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"16 how a particular underwater habitat, where minerals and organisms co-exist, is formed","x":0.092402458741003099,"y":0.26308139546462517,"w":0.83572896321614587,"h":0.015988371857499573},{"h":0.017497598878753573,"x":0.13552361913491762,"y":0.28633720932601736,"c":1,"w":0.76591374715169269,"t":"reference to the fact that the countries of the world have yet to agree on rules for"},{"t":"the exploration of the seabed","h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"x":0.13757699811252222,"y":0.30523255834346574,"w":0.27926078796386722},{"t":"Questions 18-23","w":0.17864476521809897,"x":0.094455851374523406,"y":0.35014749256427424,"h":0.014749262536873031,"c":1},{"w":0.75975357055664072,"t":"Look at the following statements (Questions 18-23) and the list of people below.","x":0.092402475394934999,"c":1,"h":0.017501886756019269,"y":0.38662790700044303},{"h":0.017441860412777732,"t":"Match each statement with the correct person or people, A-E.","c":1,"y":0.42151162790957586,"w":0.5893223571777344,"x":0.092402477010777626},{"t":"Write the correct letter, A-E, in boxes 18-23 on your answer sheet.","c":1,"w":0.62833674112955729,"x":0.094455859311679172,"y":0.45781710941644205,"h":0.017473588228929082},{"t":"NB You may use any letter more than once.","h":0.016009810118548629,"c":1,"x":0.094455846397886109,"w":0.42505134582519527,"y":0.49852507347714869},{"y":0.53185840701195763,"t":"18 A move away from the exploration of heavily mined reserves on land is a good idea.","c":1,"w":0.83778233846028649,"h":0.017699115044247815,"x":0.092402465161707137},{"w":0.026694043477376306,"y":0.55668604675806888,"x":0.092402464803064077,"t":"19","c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"w":0.80287475585937496,"h":0.016058688318483227,"x":0.12320327903407484,"t":"The negative effects of undersea exploration on local areas and their inhabitants are","y":0.55516224179379925,"c":1},{"t":"being ignored.","c":1,"y":0.57221504689169778,"x":0.13746540730905107,"w":0.13985357920328781,"h":0.018360603805136932},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.09240246506904784,"w":0.032854207356770831,"c":1,"y":0.59738372110036542,"t":"20"},{"c":1,"w":0.694045155843099,"t":"There are more worthwhile things to extract from the sea than minerals.","y":0.5973451329633036,"h":0.016026959939692276,"x":0.12320329466571943},{"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"x":0.092402464105619919,"t":"21","y":0.62063953502115032,"w":0.024640657107035321},{"x":0.13757700749631169,"w":0.77412729899088539,"t":"No other form of human exploration will have such a destructive impact on marine","y":0.62063953499899227,"h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1},{"y":0.63547189128099424,"x":0.13928404617840651,"h":0.020319940347587107,"c":1,"t":"life as deep-sea mining.","w":0.23073338826497397},{"w":0.76203943888346348,"c":1,"t":"22 More is known about outer space than about what lies beneath the oceans.","y":0.65805052959389698,"x":0.092277141751646641,"h":0.023956235812476967},{"t":"23","x":0.090349075385581873,"w":0.034907598495483388,"y":0.68313953465403088,"h":0.020348837523333718,"c":1},{"t":"There is one marine life habitat where experts agree mining should not take place.","x":0.12320328175729779,"y":0.68168604618503847,"h":0.020378850976274454,"w":0.79671457926432299,"c":1},{"y":0.72221675409089414,"w":0.19566410064697265,"h":0.023160987336375394,"c":1,"t":"List of People","x":0.41447899952258399},{"y":0.75280235934487094,"h":0.020453454751883982,"c":1,"t":"A Professor Mat Upton","x":0.23613963221269055,"w":0.26078028361002603},{"x":0.23379158366050223,"w":0.48722595214843756,"y":0.77838688089919861,"t":"B Julie Hunter, Julian Aguon and Pradeep Singh","c":1,"h":0.02695841493859763},{"t":"C Dr Jon Copley","c":1,"w":0.18685831705729164,"x":0.23613962985602219,"y":0.80959302374043352,"h":0.019020545306810632},{"t":"Mike Johnston","y":0.83547941968888761,"c":1,"x":0.2607088685478704,"h":0.022355113971901486,"w":0.1664672724405924},{"w":0.18944886525472004,"h":0.022045344800020739,"c":1,"t":"Verena Tunnicliffe","y":0.86308669822320905,"x":0.26871405906047785},{"y":0.92005813948177184,"c":1,"w":0.034907598495483402,"t":"90","h":0.017441860412777732,"x":0.088295687321233482},{"y":0.94166666659226195,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.45294118245442705,"h":0.04166666666666663,"x":0.51176470218665204,"c":1}]}